    {
      "id": 28,
      "type": "MarkdownNote",
      "title": "Instructions, file order, and original-method credit",
      "pos": [
        -1900,
        1520
      ],
      "size": [
        2510,
        470
      ],
      "flags": {},
      "order": 27,
      "mode": 0,
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Seven semantic inputs → sixteen generated outputs\n\nThe seven photographs are **inputs**, used together as equal, complementary Qwen semantic survey evidence. The decoder returns **6 generated room-establishing views + 10 generated contextual views of the cream cube**. Every cube study retains the complete cube, its rug or floor contact, and recognizable room anchors; isolated macro/product shots are forbidden. No input is VAE-encoded or used as a master, source-frame, composition, pixel, or timeline anchor. The `source_image` connection only assigns the `<Picture 1>` label in this preset; it does not make that photograph stronger than Pictures 2–7.\n\n### Silver Estate source order\n\nUpload/select the seven photographs in this order: **Picture 1 = original 3.png**, **Picture 2 = 6.png**, **Picture 3 = 1.png**, **Picture 4 = 7.png**, **Picture 5 = 2.png**, **Picture 6 = 5.png**, **Picture 7 = 4.png**. The placeholder filenames are intentionally not bundled in the repository.\n\nKeep **H3 Edit Options** on **scene coverage | room + object study**; its canonical preset forces all-semantic Qwen-only generation, 362 frames, 16 hard-cut captures, 360° coverage, and five-frame static extraction windows. The cube is locked to the same world-space orientation while background parallax proves that only the camera changed position. Use the FL2VA diffusion model shown here.\n\n## Credit and inspiration\n\nThe continuous H3 camera/character-sheet method that inspired this extension was created by **C_Nugget / PoopMan333**. Their excellent original project includes workflows, prompts, examples, and usage guidance.\n\n### [Open the original H3 Character Sheet Generator on Hugging Face](https://huggingface.co/PoopMan333/H3_Character_Sheet_Generator)\n\nPlease visit and support the original creator."
      ]
    }
